# ==============================================================================
# SMART POLICE SYSTEM (INDIAN POLICE SERVICE & CITIZEN PORTAL)
# ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# Legal & Regulatory Alignment: BNS (2023), BNSS (2023), BSA (2023), CCTNS
